---
import { SITE } from '@/lib/blog';
---

<section class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-600 to-violet-600 px-6 py-10 text-white shadow-lg sm:px-10 sm:py-12">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-row">
    <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">订阅 {SITE.name}</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-primary-100">
        当有新文章发布时，通过 RSS 第一时间获取更新。也欢迎通过邮件与我交流。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href="/rss.xml"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-primary-700 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md"
      >
        <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M4 11a9 9 0 019 9h2.5A11.5 11.5 0 004 8.5V11zm0 4a5 5 0 015 5h2.5A7.5 7.5 0 004 12.5V15zm1.5 4a1.5 1.5 0 100-3 1.5 1.5 0 000 3z"></path>
        </svg>
        RSS 订阅
      </a>
      <a
        href="mailto:bber_cn@qq.com"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white ring-1 ring-white/30 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white/25"
      >
        <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M20 4H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 4l-8 5-8-5V6l8 5 8-5v2z"></path>
        </svg>
        邮件联系
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
